flowchart TD
    Start([Process Arrival / Scheduling Tick]) --> EvalEmergency{Is In-Flight Emergency Declared?}
    
    EvalEmergency -- Yes --> SetPriority5[Set Effective Priority = 5<br/>Emergency Maximum]
    SetPriority5 --> PushQueue[Insert Process into ReadyQueue]

    EvalEmergency -- No --> CheckAging{Is Priority Aging Active?}
    CheckAging -- Yes --> CalcWait[Calculate Waiting Time = CurrentTime - ArrivalTime]
    CalcWait --> CheckThreshold{WaitingTime >= AgingThreshold?}
    CheckThreshold -- Yes --> IncrementPriority[EffectivePriority = min MaxCap, BasePriority + Boost]
    CheckThreshold -- No --> UseBasePriority[EffectivePriority = BasePriority]
    CheckAging -- No --> UseBasePriority
    
    IncrementPriority --> PushQueue
    UseBasePriority --> PushQueue

    PushQueue --> SortQueue[Sort ReadyQueue by: <br/>1. Effective Priority DESC <br/>2. Arrival Time ASC (FCFS) <br/>3. Flight ID ASC]

    SortQueue --> DispatchRequest{Scheduler Dispatches Next Process?}
    DispatchRequest -- No --> WaitTick([Wait for Next Tick / Event])
    
    DispatchRequest -- Yes --> PopHead[Pop Candidate Process from Queue Head]
    PopHead --> CheckRunway{Compatible FREE Runway Available?}

    CheckRunway -- No --> ReinsertHead[Push Candidate Back to Head of ReadyQueue]
    ReinsertHead --> WaitRunway([Wait for Runway Release])

    CheckRunway -- Yes --> OccupyRunway[Transition Process to RUNNING<br/>Occupy Runway Exclusively]
    OccupyRunway --> ExecBurst[Execute Burst Time Duration Non-Preemptively]
    ExecBurst --> CompleteProc[Transition Process to COMPLETED<br/>Release Runway & Record Metrics]
    CompleteProc --> Done([Process Finished])
